msgstr "Posunie klip pozdĺž osi X / Y"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/zoom_pan.rst:75
msgid ""
"As of this writing and with version 23.04 the effect seems to be missing "
"several parameters in order to make it useful as a zoom and pan effect, like "
"the |ken_burns|. A bug report has been created. Until this is fixed use the :"
"doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/"
"transform` effect."
msgstr ""
"K dátumu tohto zápisu a s verziou 23.04 sa zdá, že efektu chýba niekoľko "
"parametrov, aby bol užitočný ako efekt priblíženia a panorámovania, ako "
"napr. |ken_burns|. Bol vytvorený hlásenie o chybe. Kým sa to neopraví, "
"použite efekt :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/transform`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/zoom_pan.rst:80
msgid "For more details refer to the |ken_burns| article in Wikipedia"
msgstr "Ďalšie podrobnosti nájdete v článku |ken_burns| na Wikipédii"

